ck and throws annotation_flag_like_value, naming the swallowed option's own form. A retry is offered only when dropping the text flag leaves exactly one valid source (no other alias, --add-json, --stdin, --file, --delete, or --edit with --if-absent). The CLI repair (src/cli/runtime/annotation-option-retry.ts) rebuilds it from the typed argv and withdraws it when the bindings would change, the text flag repeats, or the pair precedes the annotation command. Codex review rounds 1-4 hardened the retry paths."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Annotation commands refuse a swallowed source option first and offer the caller's own command without the text flag"}],"before_hash":"19ce4dbf35e2a57cc0f47f392a400ef9a3ba0eeb4c93e0896177fe15c1acccda","after_hash":"2ac3ba9350b61341511a2e42671cec845f3adfa81a37eaf9d8d0e4b29dd24648","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-07T19:07:03.694Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ef48f1b279ccef1bebebecf930b7828ae30caae546134df8d9b72e67420ef3f1"}
